			text = [=[Dolanaar is the village of the road, halfway between {link:shadowglen}Shadowglen{/link} and {link:darnassus}Darnassus{/link}. Its houses are grown from living wood around a moonwell, where {link:corithras-moonrage}Corithras Moonrage{/link} continues the story that {link:tenaron-stormgrip}Tenaron{/link} began. Innkeeper Keldamyr offers rest to travellers. Druids such as {link:athridas-bearmantle}Athridas Bearmantle{/link} and {link:tallonkai-swiftroot}Tallonkai Swiftroot{/link} watch the troubles of the forest from here, and the {link:sentinel-kyra-starsong}Sentinel Kyra Starsong{/link} sends her sisters out along the roads. Dolanaar is proud of its good name, and its people would rather keep certain shames to themselves.]=],
