• They prey on the road to {link:darnassus}Darnassus{/link} and the patrols at the {link:pools-of-arlithrien}Pools of Arlithrien{/link}.
• Their mystic Ferocitas the Dream Eater stole an emerald that drew power from the Dream.]=],
